{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>מטתם</b> — two times here, and the other: ומטה אהרן בתוך מטותם. It is in the Midrash: also in the episode of Korah, the staff of Aaron swallowed their staffs. And when they took them out, it vomited them back, and therefore they did not sprout. Therefore it is written ויוצא משה את כל המטת — defective, because he swallowed them."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:07.251197854Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}